    "answer_id": 79443694,
    "body": "<p>I think the best approach here would be to use the <code>ignoreErrors</code> option <a href=\"https://docs.sentry.io/platforms/javascript/configuration/filtering/\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://docs.sentry.io/platforms/javascript/configuration/filtering/</a></p>\n<pre><code>Sentry.init({\n  ignoreErrors: [\n    &quot;Can't find variable: gmo&quot;\n  ],\n});\n</code></pre>\n",
