    "body": "<p>try this:</p>\n<pre><code>implementation(&quot;com.arthenica:ffmpeg-kit-full:6.0-2.LTS&quot;)\n</code></pre>\n<p>or this:</p>\n<pre><code>implementation(&quot;com.arthenica:mobile-ffmpeg-min:4.4.LTS&quot;)\n</code></pre>\n",
