    "body": "<p>I'm using the below version with RN 0.72.4</p>\n<p>&quot;react-native-safe-area-context&quot;: &quot;^3.3.2&quot;,</p>\n<p>And importing from the package instead of react-native</p>\n<pre><code>import {SafeAreaView} from 'react-native-safe-area-context';\n</code></pre>\n",
